OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a mainly cloudy day
OL,6,Fwith a few showers spreading up from
OL,7,Fthe southwest. Some of these could be
OL,8,Fheavy, especially in the afternoon.
OL,9,
OL,10,CTonight:FShowers at first, heavy in
OL,11,Fplaces, but these dying out through
OL,12,Fthe evening. Remaining cloudy
OL,13,Fovernight with more showers moving up
OL,14,Ffrom the south.
OL,15,
OL,16,CMonday:FA mainly dry and bright
OL,17,Fmorning with just isolated showers.
OL,18,FThe showers developing more widely for
OL,19,Fa time in the afternoon, heavy in
OL,20,Fplaces, then dying out. Feeling warm.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
